<title>USA: IPO PRICING - FieldWorks prices below range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - FieldWorks prices below range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		     FieldWorks Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At				     $6.50</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		   $7.50</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,125,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	     RJ Steichen &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The company lowered the price range for its planned initial public offering to $7.50 from $8 to $10.</p>
<p>The company raised the number of shares for its planned initial public offering for the second time to 2.125 million shares from 1.85 million. The offering initially proposed 1.75 million shares.</p>
</text>
